paradis_tts/onnx_models.py adapts the single-sentence text forward and
convolutional STFT from Paradee training/scripts/export_paradee.py,
Sahil Mahendrakar, commit 9c8b4d7504cbee7e64de2d0341bb690f0b0ab708,
Apache-2.0. Changes: French A_full_phase, three explicit deterministic ONNX
stages, host excitation and host postprocessing, CPU parity checks and
